{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802600/extras/d85de45ceeeac75e4958a1e5b1f9f8e9.poster.avif?t=1768652191\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802600/extras/d85de45ceeeac75e4958a1e5b1f9f8e9.webm?t=1768652191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802600/extras/d85de45ceeeac75e4958a1e5b1f9f8e9.mp4?t=1768652191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A New Adventure in Classic Metroidvania Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beholgar II is a pixel-art Metroidvania platformer inspired by the spirit of the '90s. Explore a vast interconnected world \u2014 from shadowy dungeons and cursed forests to forgotten temples and the very edge of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Powers &amp; Magic: Unlock powerful abilities and spells to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious, Layered Levels: Every corner hides secrets, enemies, or valuable upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Weapons: Equip ancient weapons to stand against monstrous bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Dark Fantasy Tale: Journey through a world inspired by Middle Eastern myths and supernatural lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Feel: Classic controls and CRT-style filters for fans of old-school platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Beholgar, this isn\u2019t just another battle \u2014 it\u2019s a journey that will shape his destiny. If you dare, descend into the depths, claim the ancient blade, and stop the Djinn King\u2019s rise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Collect 5000 gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco